WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.417
You're in my home!

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.792
And you're about to burn.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:07.833
Factor 50 okay?

00:00:40.208 --> 00:00:42.083
-Hi. Hello.
-Hello. Hi.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.792
We've got
some really good news.

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:45.042
Good news just for you.

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:47.125
Won't take
too much of your time.

00:00:47.208 --> 00:00:48.958
You could be
one of our lucky winners.

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:49.875
That's very kind,

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:51.333
but don't
wanna waste your time.

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.083
Oh, you won't be doing that.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:56.375
But I'm moving out today
and I'm in a bit of a rush.

00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:57.583
Oh, okay.

00:00:57.667 --> 00:00:59.625
Well, can I just
give you something then?

00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:10.958
Okay. Here's how it goes.

00:01:11.042 --> 00:01:13.667
We need to know
where Carlton Flynn is.

00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:18.500
I understand.

00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:21.875
You need
a little persuasion.

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:35.667
Actually. Would you mind?

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.000
Thank you.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.333
I think, first of all...

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:42.917
Hi, Mr Sutton?

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.875
We have some great news.

00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:47.333
Some great news
just for you.

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:49.542
This is a God thing,
I don't believe in God.

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:51.208
Haven't believed
for some time,

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:52.958
so if collecting,
I wouldn't bother.

00:02:53.042 --> 00:02:54.667
No. It's not that.

00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:19.042
Lucy!

00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:24.000
Somebody call an ambulance!

00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.833
Understudy for Josephine,
where are you?

00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:30.000
Right here, sir.

00:03:34.958 --> 00:03:36.500
Rerig the ropes.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:37.583
Nice to meet you.

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.875
Pleasure is entirely mine.

00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:42.583
Awful about Lucy.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:45.333
Is it though?

00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:04.250
Mum, he's hanging on!

00:04:15.292 --> 00:04:17.333
Ray. What's going on?

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:20.458
Why we here?

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:24.000
I remember something.

00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:26.917
Remembered what?

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.292
This is where it happened,
that night,

00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:30.542
before I came to see you.

00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:38.708
I was here.

